note bin_@T@: d = a op b on @T@ f32 lanes; op 0 add, 1 sub, 2 mul, 3 div (one rounding each, as ggml-cpu).
fn bin_@T@ op ulong a view f32 @T@ b view f32 @T@ d edit f32 @T@ to void
for i ulong @T@
x = get a i
y = get b i
if eq op 0
put d i add x y
else
if eq op 1
put d i sub x y
else
if eq op 2
put d i mul x y
else
put d i div x y
end
end
end
end
end
